<title>USA: Fairchild Corp names Eric Steiner COO.</title>
<headline>Fairchild Corp names Eric Steiner COO.</headline>
<dateline>CHANTILLY, Va. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fairchild Corp said on Monday it had named Eric Steiner chief operating officer and executive vice president.</p>
<p>The company said Steiner has been serving as senior vice president of Operations since 1992.</p>
<p>Steiner will continue as president and chief executive of the Fairchild Fasteners unit, positions he has occupied since February 1995, the company said.</p>
